Backport of https://github.com/krishna-swaroop/KiCAD-Prism/pull/682
Upstream head: adeacc4145e0b12f7e0097e59549c1719b5c74a0
Target: 0e627ec3593cac06a061cc5c61285216589869cb (frontend)

The pinned version keeps the viewer host in visualizer.tsx, before the
EcadViewer adapter was introduced. Load all sources in one replaceSources
call and wait for the independent support-file request before mounting.
Preserve the decode-race retry and fall back to the default page layout
when the support request fails. The upstream backend change is a docstring
only and is not needed for this backport.

Remove when the pinned upstream includes PR #682. The regression tests
cover schematic and PCB loading, delayed support files, and HTTP/network
failures.

